Dear Sirs,

I happened to have that Asus chip (AS99127F).

I've noticed the note about 'fans stopping under high server loads' 
while reading the docs of kernel driver w83781d.o, known problem 
section. I just want to inform you, that exactly the same happens under 
Micro$oft Windows, ASUS hardware monitoring software
called "ASUS PC Probe", to be exact. They're stopping once a few hours 
for approximately 3 seconds.

The mainboards are ASUS CUSL2-C (I have 2 of them) and newer TUSL2-C 
(two, too). Same results in every case.

So, this is probably a hardware bug.

